  "segments": [
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_8490408901_001.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "2009年，澳大利亚的大卫·拉斯顿和迪·德斯顿向全球的古老月季及遗产月季爱好者发起了一项投票活动，选出他们最喜爱的茶月季，投票者来自亚欧非美澳等十几个国家和地区，通过word federation of rose societies heritage rose group收集反馈，整理出了世界上最受欢迎的茶月季排名表"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c8742c44cc1def9913ca28aa0f066c37.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/19ed4c7868bc1ada6391891232383453.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/4adb327d00e2863125970c4b0b1c927f.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/76292844b6bfd3a73ffd49d579f6fdea.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_8490408901_002.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "荣登榜首的是Monsieur Tillier，替利尔先生（可能就是约瑟夫大公）"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a541ea208fca46f9319f397dbad82f97.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c46cade10021b2c1cc77320936ed27be.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/bb98eabb6059d8b34ee01dc889b3e753.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "替利尔花色多变，花色外深里浅，从偏朱红的粉色到深粉紫色，有时花心还有一抹橙"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0cb7eacf572373de967457508553922a.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0219a591a7cb72d63c2f8ec0047dee57.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "有趣的是，替利尔初开高杯，半开包菜型，完全绽放是菊花型。非常张扬不羁"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/2f7803f390d0c420202c4615e3d74a59.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/4a33fd7a556006ec1907dec346b0dfb0.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d63d6b336cfbd66e5785e5ec966d1fba.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c05511ce63d2c8b1337833be57b422ed.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "无论是世界投票还是澳大利亚本土投票排名，替利尔都是第一名。 它足够健壮，放任生长足以长至5m*5m，开花和抗病都很好，株型也较为丰满，可以长成花树。适合亚热带和热带气候。 即使花朵是不符合“主流”的菊花形，也丝毫不影响它得到最多古老月季爱好者的喜爱。 换而言之，花型并不是唯一决定因素，假如把目光仅局限在几加仑小盆，把勺瓣球形花或密密麻麻的美人尖作为唯一标准，那么我们就不能看到月季更完全的美丽"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/4ae0b6c2575fedf9d9b99b98b5206e4d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/9d5295417e0ca35b16f3b45263cdbf04.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/33b105130fc1b40402d42d83db1dd881.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/1379da75e4c950edb56af2289b19c07d.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "大卫·拉斯顿在搭梯子修剪替利尔残花"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/903c2ab48ec2ac59019e77373bec9948.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a8887a94de9a2731f53692cbf2028c03.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/edff9f83090d07f823190ccf1f4a1383.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/884c0c17decd19ac584e631cea12d6fc.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第二名， Duchesse de Branbant，伯班夫人"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/ba342fabd6bb48b0d798107f3cdc2ff5.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/64a3e2e15b4221d5b1d5d51f81806664.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/644284cae31c66c3ab809223eaa07bf4.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/6c29917c3e733f45eda23e676a95b2f8.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "伯班夫人拥有淡雅的色彩和松散的球状花朵，轻盈飘逸惹人怜爱。1930s传入中国后被称为玉玲珑，明治时期传入日本后被称为樱镜、随一香"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/9587bde45e6407df79b8104cce7bc1e9.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d208081d0a8b3df8e60b86e57dade0b8.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/9247afac9754b750052aed49af34071f.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/b6939e44c96adc0f70840d9ffe6117dd.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "花朵有时呈现更诱人的水润感。同时长势也不差，跟其他茶月季一样可以长成大花树。吧里有介绍它的帖子，不再赘述"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/adae07d755ceba33b81b5d4289b0bd46.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3ef31a13ae07d85ca64947134d68324d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0f6d125780f575c34446148711e0b64c.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/79cbf9f498746680e6f8c73dc15fc166.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第三名，Lady Hillingdon，希灵顿夫人"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/461ef89c95c9cb6540cb0d79bc7d8fe2.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/b0ae657d17e1f0ca8922b9ef44f5e966.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0ce026431091e7dafbfbe255fc55655d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/34acdf78155413cd11b9583b9dc2f5f9.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "希灵顿夫人拥有杏黄色大花，宜人茶香，长势抗病在老月季中也属于中上，这个品种引入国内很早，吧里也有很多种植介绍贴，不赘述 参考：http://tieba.baidu.com/p/7043559294?&amp;share=9105&amp;fr=sharewise&amp;is_video=false&amp;unique=DD86FD9A10BB873D782966C4B23B350B&amp;st=1688465623&amp;client_type=1&amp;client_version=12.43.1.1&amp;sfc=copy&amp;share_from=post&amp;source=12_16_sharecard_a"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3b94491cbf47e957d9d24ab5a905f05a.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d4326de3a8ad2dc22b065d7426ab88d3.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/fbb09fda2ab86dee855f09a2ebbfa0c6.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/94563ae5beccb213ff27f765e9b034a2.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第四名，G. Nabonnand（吉尔伯特·纳邦德？）"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/ea8c2fce60e2c90840702eb2b7b18914.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/2b598345ebcb23779decfe738e15452d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/476179bf1f1e96de810b526d704c5606.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/deffa039b163db9f73eb22c6cfc5b575.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "纳邦德延续萨弗拉诺一系的美感：花大，半重瓣，色彩温柔，丰花且勤花，株型优雅端庄，枝叶乃至花蕾都有极高的观赏性"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/68760571d76f36bc53447e818b232e4d.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "那邦德颜色是浅淡的粉白、香槟混合色，有点类似哈密瓜色。有时候又会呈现纯粉白色，有时候又会呈现淡黄色，开花性极佳，花型从高杯翘角到卷边盘状，花朵优雅微微下垂，花蕾长而尖，花托浑圆"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d881599f3743137d16a8fa8c25b58c0d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/03daf108aa920d66646d7e610b94e884.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "纳邦德又是一个不符合“主流”审美的茶月季，然而查阅helpmefind对纳邦德的记载：“它有着让人无法忘记的最精致的粉红色和象牙白，仿佛一阵轻风就能将松散宽大的，贝壳一般的花瓣吹动” “它是最值得种的月季，那邦德把它留给了我们”（它的培育者就叫吉尔伯特·纳邦德，他以自己的名字命名了这个月季，足以见得对其喜爱） “即使剪下80朵左右的大花（用作装饰）灌木丛上仿佛什么也没有发生，依旧覆盖着几百朵鲜花”"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0176d76864a75f12dd6a268acb9a8c6f.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c00d82a6f81226854fd5a76e8edb5ef7.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/f5dcc3d42d98a10957d136a82ededde9.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d2bd592c30fcf1a33760fb2a8eca7d04.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "因为开花性和勤花度非常好，纳邦德往往长不成替利尔那样的巨大花树，然而它分枝极多，可以长成丰满圆润的灌木，枝叶细而不弱，花不至于倒垂，而枝条曲屈有致，红梗绿叶，是茶月季的另一种美"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/770cb1a246b04051ea3df5f7324ff6f1.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/a3f4397d57eb46c2401850ba1da5c7cb.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/590627004d2e0bbc0018932ca3c81f4f.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/4f13a2066f240ff8c87db623354e58c0.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第五名，Général Galliéni，加利尔尼将军"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/9a57d85a8ed2f53991c62240bf55bb4d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/5b5f36feb6678fa269d557d4af27fc94.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/98bab1744dd53ed26a631d34e72ade07.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/274ef05fe96663bd1a0c368a81e2b1a1.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "加利尔尼实际上不具备典型的茶月季的特征，它既没有高杯翘角花型，花朵也不优雅“点头”，但是它的花色却是少见的火焰色，每一朵花的颜色都各不相同，花瓣略皱缩，有点类似查尔斯大公。当然，由于强健的长势和良好的开花性以及耀眼的色彩，它依旧得到了古老月季爱好者的喜爱"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/19a88a0342bd31696b1dbb52d22d847d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/36726f0a2772b2048fbbb61091a2a73a.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d7e94de97ba768e1923f37f1cfe344d7.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/19d93bd49581420f343bf34b8641d81b.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "与纳博南一样，加利尔尼因为优良开花性导致株型较小，同时抗病非常强大，因而不失为花园月季的一个选择"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/56ba7b02b06b56f7feacd686d2fafa09.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/54377747086d4d6b29dad235dd606888.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3bbf649573f1ec7bc4dcc565db238297.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/473aabf079b1f06aafb483bd8288650f.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第六名，Sombreuil，索伯伊（索伯依）"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/43f623897dba5e3b943676093f470bbb.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/5fd6d7ea403f412740f7f4f51c9084bb.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/893f3898d154ac792841b55f1dc5dc73.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/2237d3103ad3302d170eb4deef72219d.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "索伯依实际上不是茶月季，是现代藤本月季冒名顶替的，从外形上看也更接近于茶-怒塞特或现代茶努月季。该品种很早就引入国内，是大花白色高度重瓣的大藤本，可长到4m。四季开花，比较丰花，也可修剪作灌木应用"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/194aee80336ffb515dc4a1f02a84979e.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/76eb49912aa4ce7a6bab8d3c028671f3.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/41d307b4edb734a767fb56ea850b719d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d4344df07bf1d5093c763706b30c0657.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "这款索伯依现在已经从茶月季里除名了。不过其白色大朵重瓣又能稳定复花，还是赢得了相当一部分人的喜爱。花朵初开微带浅粉色，有点波莱罗味"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/80c95bfa32eed2db88635b19ffd41f44.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c50945baaed094b26dc404c4c3d5ebaa.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0eb4513a61fc22efc4b1726da8ecbb1d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/29f2803c86c9396e7c419294bf24d1e1.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "索柏伊Sombreuil 索伯依国内介绍贴"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d4bd025c008e16cf99d75684f4877ea7.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/3bf470a56adf75fd52943fc331442df2.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/d8161d5da4046cf9fb2d9fdbd004e09d.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/1f41f45c967b0f18c1e59935d2fbb4b4.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第七名，Souvenir de Madame Léonie Viennot，工厂月季"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/39fdfb09080ca2a3b9844b642a9cc8d6.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/88dae6c67d34c8da4aa19b9b805c1b28.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c2480e0433ec57443f24abdf90109f64.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/e50e563259dc4cd95edba59890f32ade.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "工厂月季也比较早传入国内，因为最初在一个工厂发现而得名工厂月季。该品种色彩华丽而不俗艳，金粉色，或粉中带黄或黄中带粉，香水月季的芙蓉花型，大藤本"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c8e7e8a29f2a996adc5de6e9f16d4139.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/bdb69c0585c3831fefcdb9f2479dc794.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/efe3cd6616b6601611012f842640bb51.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "一季花，偶尔复花。某种程度上它是橘黄香水月季的代餐，但是色号不同，花朵也没有香水月季繁密。但是它的重瓣大花，红梗，尖而大的青叶，也具有极高的观赏性和美感。上榜名至实归"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/1bb026327b49e5802ee44aeb358f719e.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/39c947b9ae1e2b1cc4cf9faf848a96aa.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/c5aa6946a623b2c5409aa2086dbe0d13.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/6af030a1328758b03f1e923668ecb1e8.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "第八名，Francis Dubreuil，（弗朗西斯·都柏林？）"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/abb1aae3dc458091494ee6e107a38163.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/411fe2f39b8eaa24369ea7e7c5493ee0.webp"
